  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 2
    text: Your client is absolutely furious. They have no choice but to pay you a
      significant sum to close out the final account, but you are blacklisted from
      future projects with them directly. The business reputation is significantly
      damaged in the process and concerns are raised on similar projects for similar
      clients who have heard how aggressively the fine account was handled.
